    "whatItIs": "monday.com Work Management is a work OS for boards, timelines/Gantt, workload views, automations, docs and dashboards. Free covers ≤2 seats and ≤3 boards. Paid plans start at a 3-seat minimum: Basic $9, Standard $12, Pro $19 per seat/month on annual billing, each bundling AI credits (~1k/2k/3k; roughly +$10/$20/$30), with Enterprise custom. 14-day Pro trial. Yearly ~18% off vs monthly. Distinct from monday sales CRM.",
